      "type": "char",
      "title": "象形入门",
      "title_en": "Picture Characters",
      "intro": "十二个字是从图画变来的，看形状就能猜到意思。",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "key": "basic-char-nature",
          "title": "自然五字",
          "title_en": "Five from Nature",
          "intro": "天上、地上、水里的五样东西。",
          "est_minutes": 8,
          "kinds": ["recognize", "pinyin", "meaning", "stroke", "listen"],
          "points": [
            { "key": "ri", "text": "日", "pinyin": "rì", "gloss": "sun", "hint": "太阳的样子，中间那一点是它的光。" },
            { "key": "yue", "text": "月", "pinyin": "yuè", "gloss": "moon", "hint": "弯弯的一钩，就是月亮。" },
            { "key": "shan", "text": "山", "pinyin": "shān", "gloss": "mountain", "hint": "三个山峰并排站着。" },
            { "key": "shui", "text": "水", "pinyin": "shuǐ", "gloss": "water", "hint": "中间一条主流，两边是水花。" },
            { "key": "huo", "text": "火", "pinyin": "huǒ", "gloss": "fire", "hint": "火苗往上跳，两边还有小火星。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "basic-char-body",
          "title": "人的样子",
          "title_en": "The Body",
          "intro": "四个从人的形状来的字。",
          "est_minutes": 8,
          "kinds": ["recognize", "pinyin", "meaning", "stroke", "listen"],
          "points": [
            { "key": "ren", "text": "人", "pinyin": "rén", "gloss": "person", "hint": "一个人侧着站，两条腿分开。" },
            { "key": "da", "text": "大", "pinyin": "dà", "gloss": "big", "hint": "人把手臂张开，看着就大了。" },
            { "key": "xiao", "text": "小", "pinyin": "xiǎo", "gloss": "small", "hint": "三粒小沙子，很小。" },
            { "key": "kou", "text": "口", "pinyin": "kǒu", "gloss": "mouth", "hint": "一张张嘴，外面是嘴唇。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "basic-char-position",
          "title": "方位三字",
          "title_en": "Position Words",
          "intro": "说清楚东西在哪儿，先学这三个字。",
          "est_minutes": 6,
          "kinds": ["recognize", "pinyin", "meaning", "stroke", "listen"],
          "points": [
            { "key": "shang", "text": "上", "pinyin": "shàng", "gloss": "up, above", "hint": "一横上面再加一竖一横，东西在上面。" },
            { "key": "xia", "text": "下", "pinyin": "xià", "gloss": "down, below", "hint": "跟「上」正好相反，东西在下面。" },
            { "key": "zhong", "text": "中", "pinyin": "zhōng", "gloss": "middle, center", "hint": "一根杆子正穿过方框的正中间。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "basic-char-tone",
          "title": "四声辨调",
          "title_en": "Four Tones",
          "intro": "同一个 ma，换个声调就是另一个字。这一课练的是看字选调、看调选字 —— 声调本身，不是听音。",
          "est_minutes": 6,
          "kinds": ["recognize", "pinyin", "meaning"],
          "points": [
            { "key": "ma-mother", "text": "妈", "pinyin": "mā", "gloss": "mother", "hint": "一声：又高又平，一路平着走，不断也不拐 ——「妈妈」。" },
            { "key": "ma-hemp", "text": "麻", "pinyin": "má", "gloss": "hemp", "hint": "二声：往上扬，像没听清时问一声「啊？」—— 从低往高挑。" },
            { "key": "ma-horse", "text": "马", "pinyin": "mǎ", "gloss": "horse", "hint": "三声：先压低、再拐着升上来，像点头 —— 中间要拐那个弯。" },
            { "key": "ma-scold", "text": "骂", "pinyin": "mà", "gloss": "to scold", "hint": "四声：从最高处一下掉到底，最干脆 —— 往下砸。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
